# Films: the finished film, its source, its stills and its credits go to GitHub.
# Render outputs and generated audio stay local — build.sh regenerates them.

# Render outputs (segments, video-only mux, mixes)
**/out/

# Generated speech and music (TTS lines, processed chunks, score renders) — the scripts next to them are kept
**/*.wav
**/*.mp3

# node_modules lives in the repo root; the film's symlink would dangle in a clone
/tay-du-ky-twist/node_modules

# Oversized intermediate WAVs (the mixed track, hundreds of MB) never enter git
**/mix.wav
